source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A run of four inside a span is four characters Jira shows, so jiro keeps all four in the code body and stays silent.
-- input.jira --
{{a\\\\b}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>a\\\\b</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`a\\\\b`
-- warnings.json --
[]
